    "description": "Read the stops of one wave: the packages inducted in it grouped by the opaque stopKey (the keyed hash of the normalized address; pkg:\u003ctrackingNumber\u003e when no label data was received), in the order of each stop's first induction. Each stop carries its trackingNumbers and destinationPostalPrefix when the label data had it; no address is ever returned. Read-only; an unknown wave fails with not-found.",
